{"id":"wb-7-991","name":"二灵塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"二灵塔","text":"二灵塔是中国浙江省宁波市鄞州区境内的一处古代佛塔，位于东钱湖东南二灵山上。二灵塔建于北宋政和年间，为浙江省范围内罕见的北宋石塔，也是北宋石构建筑的代表。1997年8月，二灵塔被列入浙江省文物保护单位，2013年3月成为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BA%8C%E7%81%B5%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86555314,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86555314","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/24c13a4ed2bfd1871d19dee4.jpg","title":"Erling_Pagoda_20130908_103551.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Erling_Pagoda_20130908_103551.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/34/Erling_Pagoda_20130908_103551.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​宁波东钱湖二灵塔","width":320,"height":478}}